Implemented a self-contained Track B generator based on the paper’s native distance-two coloring problem.

Files:

- [gen_2403_12302.py](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2403.12302/gen_2403_12302.py)
- [selftest_report.json](/home/gson/gvrepo/results/2403.12302/selftest_report.json)
