The family generates irregular planar triangular-lattice patches with \(\Delta=6\) and requests a 19-color distance-two coloring, matching Theorem 1.2’s \(2\Delta+7\) bound in the [paper](https://arxiv.org/abs/2403.12302). A mod-7 lattice coloring is carried through affine transformations and relabeling; generation never solves the emitted instance.

Local results:

- All 9 gates pass.
- Planted certificates: 12/12.
- Random guessing: 0/200,000.
- Five attacks: 0/8 successes each.
- Reference greedy algorithm: 8/8, averaging 8,792 operations.
